      <p class="lead">In modern digital work environments, professionals handle hundreds of micro-tasks every day: stripping rich text formatting from copied emails, resizing an avatar for a team dashboard, converting units for shipping logistics, or generating a QR code for a marketing flyer. Installing heavy desktop software suites for these simple tasks slows down your operating system and wastes storage. This guide examines how lightweight, single-purpose browser utilities maximize daily productivity.</p>

