      <p>Generating passwords, authentication secrets, or customer QR codes on third-party servers creates severe data leak liabilities. Client-side utilities run calculations in your browser memory using hardware-level Web APIs, ensuring that your generated credentials and assets are never transmitted or logged across the web.</p>

